 "notes": [
  {
   "text": "Scene order is not a fixed route: VMGM PGC 2 seeds g[14], g[15], g[8] from rnd; the dispatcher VMGM PGC 4 picks the next title from g[1].",
   "why": "A blind timed key sequence cannot reach a chosen scene; play by the nav FIFO."
  },
  {
   "text": "After the first shootout the game waits on a route menu: VTS 12 PGC 1 (still 255, 4 link buttons, fosl 1). b1 -> VTS 15 (sheriff's office), b2 -> VTS 3 (saloon), b3 -> VTS 7, b4 -> VTS 14. Later visits are VTS 12 PGC 2..15, offering only the routes not yet played.",
   "why": "The autoplayer only knew shots and stalled there on 2026-10-23."
  },
  {
   "text": "The intro (VTS 1 cell 1, 33 s) has one button, LinkPTT 2: Select skips to the first shootout (policy intro_skip).",
   "why": "Saves ~30 s per run. NOT for first-shootout timing or the purple-blip check: the skip enters cell 2 by a jump, which arms differently and bypasses the cell 1 -> 2 junction."
  },
  {
   "text": "The continue screen is VTS 4 PGC 3 (one 10 s cell, b1 = Continue, forced select). Continue -> a 7-12 s intro ending in a 2 s still -> the duel (VTS 4 PGC 1 cell 4, 6 or 8 at random; targets b11, b11/b18, b20).",
   "why": "Duel scenarios lose all three lives first (~3.5 min). The intro-to-duel jump keeps the VBUF, so the picture counters do NOT reset: lock base on the first video_live edge after the still."
  },
  {
   "text": "Shots are 'if (g[R] != K) Link' (or '== K') cell commands read after a Set-only highlight; the 7x5 grid's edge links point at themselves, so Up x4 + Left x6 homes to b1 from anywhere.",
   "why": "The autoplayer's aim depends on it (disc_timing.scoring_targets)."
  },
  {
   "text": "The duel opens on a static standoff: the picture matcher's margin is ~0 there, so a PTS read off the capture is not a measurement.",
   "why": "A 'v0.9.1 arms 0.4-0.7 s early' claim came from exactly that and was retracted; trust HLI_ARM late_ticks or elapsed time since the cut."
  },
  {
   "text": "Every PTS-restart junction drops the outgoing cell's last 5 pictures and the next cell's first on screen (pre-existing, all builds).",
   "why": "Expect it in junction reports; it is not a regression of whatever is under test."
  }
 ],
